{"id":"n-20261016-ny74ai","category":"gaming","display_title":"The Mummy Franchise Returns in 2027","display_title_he":"זיכיון המומיה חוזר ב-2027","short_summary":"Universal Pictures has officially announced the title and release date for the upcoming fourth installment of The Mummy franchise, featuring the return of original stars Brendan Fraser and Rachel Weisz.","english_level":"C1","words":406,"reading_time":3,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"Polygon","domain":"polygon.com","url":"https://www.polygon.com/the-mummy-4-release-date-title-revealed","title":"The Mummy Officially Returns in 1 Year — Now With a New Cryptic Title","published_at":"2026-10-15T21:12:33.000Z"},{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/the-mummy-4-now-officially-titled-the-mummy-book-of-the-dead","title":"The Mummy 4 Now Officially Titled The Mummy: Book of the Dead","published_at":"2026-10-15T19:46:23.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:46:23.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-16T06:01:16.445Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":9,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Enthusiasts of classic adventure cinema have substantial cause for celebration, as Universal Pictures recently confirmed official details regarding the continuation of a remarkably beloved franchise spanning twenty-seven years. Exactly one year prior to its scheduled theatrical release, studio representatives revealed that the fourth installment will be officially titled The Mummy: Book of the Dead. According to the announcements, the film remains on track and is slated to arrive in theaters on October 15, 2027.","This upcoming sequel promises a profoundly nostalgic reunion by bringing back key original cast members. Brendan Fraser and Rachel Weisz are set to reprise their iconic roles as Rick and Evie O'Connell, directly addressing the creative misstep of the third film where Weisz sat out and the character of Evie was recast with Maria Bello. Recent set photos showcasing a very stylish Weisz alongside Fraser in full costume indicate that the narrative might take place in the late 1950s. Additionally, other familiar faces will return to the screen, including John Hannah, Michael Johnston, Numan Acar, Kevin J. O'Connor, and Oded Fehr, who is confirmed to step back into his role as the dedicated Medjai warrior leader Ardeth Bay.","Behind the camera, the production enlists notable creative talent. The film will be directed by Matt Bettinelli-Olpin and Tyler Gillett from the Radio Silence collective, while David Coggeshall has penned the screenplay. Longtime producer Sean Daniel, who has been involved with every single film in the series, will continue his role to maintain the continuity of the franchise.","While official plot details remain under wraps, the subtitle and the inclusion of characters tied to ancient lore leave ample room for speculation among eager fans. The presence of the Book of the Dead—an ancient tome containing spells capable of bringing the dead back to life and summoning the Warriors of the Book—alongside the return of Ardeth Bay strongly hints at the potential resurgence of the titular mummy Imhotep, whose actor Arnold Vosloo has been indicated to return by John Hannah, even if not yet officially confirmed. Furthermore, Kevin J. O'Connor is reprising his role as Beni, which suggests his character might not be dead after all and could be doing Imhotep's bidding once more. Fehr's enthusiastic return is particularly notable, given his previous absence from the 2008 film due to the lack of Imhotep as the primary antagonist. As the release date approaches, audiences eagerly await trailers and further updates regarding this highly anticipated cinematic return."],"facts":[{"fact":"Universal Pictures announced that the upcoming fourth Mummy movie is officially titled The Mummy: Book of the Dead.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"The film is scheduled to hit theaters on October 15, 2027, exactly one year from its title announcement.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Brendan Fraser and Rachel Weisz are returning to star as Rick and Evie O'Connell.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Other returning cast members include John Hannah, Kevin J. O'Connor, and Oded Fehr as Ardeth Bay.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"The film is directed by Matt Bettinelli-Olpin and Tyler Gillett, with a screenplay by David Coggeshall and production by Sean Daniel.","sources":[2]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Enthusiasts","lemma":"enthusiast","pos":"noun","he":"חובבים, מעריצים","name":false},{"text":"classic","lemma":"classic","pos":"adjective","he":"קלאסי","name":false},{"text":"adventure","lemma":"adventure","pos":"noun","he":"הרפתקה","name":false},{"text":"cinema","lemma":"cinema","pos":"noun","he":"קולנוע","name":false},{"text":"substantial","lemma":"substantial","pos":"adjective","he":"משמעותי, ניכר","name":false},{"text":"cause","lemma":"cause","pos":"noun","he":"סיבה","name":false},{"text":"celebration","lemma":"celebration","pos":"noun","he":"חגיגה","name":false},{"text":"Universal Pictures","lemma":"Universal Pictures","pos":"proper noun","he":"יוניברסל פיקצ'רס","name":true},{"text":"confirmed","lemma":"confirm","pos":"verb","he":"אישרו","name":false},{"text":"official","lemma":"official","pos":"adjective","he":"רשמי","name":false},{"text":"details","lemma":"detail","pos":"noun","he":"פרטים","name":false},{"text":"continuation","lemma":"continuation","pos":"noun","he":"המשך","name":false},{"text":"remarkably","lemma":"remarkably","pos":"adverb","he":"באופן ניכר","name":false},{"text":"beloved","lemma":"beloved","pos":"adjective","he":"אהוב","name":false},{"text":"franchise","lemma":"franchise","pos":"noun","he":"זיכיון","name":false},{"text":"spanning","lemma":"span","pos":"verb","he":"המפרש, הנמשך","name":false},{"text":"twenty-seven","lemma":"twenty-seven","pos":"adjective","he":"עשרים ושבעה","name":false},{"text":"years","lemma":"year","pos":"noun","he":"שנים","name":false},{"text":"prior","lemma":"prior","po